  "location": "2.7 and Table 2",
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "remifentanil: 2.7 and Table 2 give different instructions for one patient",
      "summary": "2.7 reads “birth to 12 years of age”. Table 2 reads “1 to 12 years”. Table 2 reads “birth to 2 months of age”. Example: A child aged 7 months has no row in Table 2, while 2.7 sends the reader to Table 2 for all children from birth to 12 years. The same text is in 6 labels from 4 labelers in the DailyMed release of 29 October 2026.",
      "impact": "Potential effect on a prescribing decision: medium. Arxo does not say which instruction is correct and gives no dose."
    }
  },
